control: A tick records as failed the account's tick and gap recovery a stopped process left running
removes: a tick's start records a stopped tick as failed and leaves a stopped recovery recorded as running
packages: ./sync/internal/tick
tests: TestATickRecordsAStoppedRunAsFailed
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

